  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It appears the Fedora Repository Webapp (3.1) is always expected at http://host:port/fedora/. I wish to run the Webapp at http://host:port/, as the \"root\" Web application on that host. We are dedicating a unique hostname to Fedora, it makes sense to have it respond to the shortest URL possible. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To be totally honest I haven't even tried this – what I've seen doesn't make me believe it's feasible. I'd love to be proven wrong.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
